our  if we have time for a few more jokes  she'll tell him aquafina is a jokester  in her own life so whenever she came  across a joke written in the script the  actor would ask  let me try just a few more what were  they gonna say no well we still have a  big chunk of it since the part was  written with her voice in mind it only  made sense  number five  this could probably be considered a  special skill if you need someone who  can belch on command luca actor jacob  tremblay is your guy  [Music]  when the luca team was recording and  they came to the part in script where  luca was meant to let out a burp  tremblay figured he'd offer his services  i was able to give them some cool sound  bites and they ended up using my burp in  the film trombley loved the experience  of improvising especially with the  encouragement of his director enrico  casarosa who let me bring a lot of that  into the experience  number six if it's good you find a way  to make it work sacha baron cohen's ugo  wasn't even a character at first so he  didn't end up being part of too many  scenes but then the team got a whole lot  of great content from the actor in the  booth some people think i'm mad to live  in the deep for director casa rosa it  was a pleasure to see cohen came in and  he improvised so much that we even put a  little button at the end of our movie to  contain more of the improvisation that  he did for us because he was so fun if  it works you better work it i think that  they are the ones who are mad not me the  one who is mad it's there  number seven  it's a fight sure but it's a hilarious  fight when barney and ron find  themselves on the run from the bubble  company they get into a bit of a scuffle  have you got water damage to the brain i  mean seriously but it was all zach  galifianakis and jack dylan grazer the  performers actually had a special  session together in the recording booth  just to improvise the fight their improv  was riddled with comedy gold so instead  of 