st and it feels good so we  wanted to keep it  number 15  use what you know elizabeth tobicky was  maybe a bit too good at this the actress  was improvising like a master in the  booth for peta rabbit too but then  director will gluck reigned on her  parade saying she was probably just  drawing on my own personal experience of  being an incredibly bossy big sister i  have two siblings and i'm so bossy and  will probably had to be like could you  just be a little less it's a children's  film and to think this was just a taste  of the feistiness she brought the  freedom to record and re-record in the  booth means more fantastic material to  bring to the table and we are here for  it which scene on our list was your  favorite

